    "Workspace owner has implicit access to every board in owned projects; nonowners need both active project membership and an explicit active grant on the specific board, and keep their project role's action limits.": "pass",
    "Migration creates no automatic board grants for existing members; invitations and project membership do not grant board access. Re-adding a removed member does not reactivate old grants.": "pass",
    "Only the owner of the board's workspace can administer board grants. Reject self-elevation, foreign boards, nonmember targets and cross-project access without disclosing hidden resource existence.": "pass",
